{"id":"605047","name":"葱油麻椒花卷儿","author":"Magic叮咚","authorId":"11490259","desc":"","cover":"images/605047/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取适量面粉加入酵母和水，和成光滑的面团。","img":"images/605047/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/605047/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面团排气，擀成长方形。","img":"images/605047/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"淋上食用油，刷匀。","img":"images/605047/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒花椒面和盐。","img":"images/605047/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"撒葱花。","img":"images/605047/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把一侧长边向中间折。","img":"images/605047/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"对边包过来。","img":"images/605047/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切成宽度均匀等份。","img":"images/605047/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取两份面叠加，捏住两头拧一下。","img":"images/605047/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把两头在底部合上。","img":"images/605047/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"做好的花卷坯子，盖薄膜饧发十分钟。","img":"images/605047/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把饧发好的花卷用刮板移至蒸锅，或者整好型直接放进垫好油纸的蒸锅饧发。","img":"images/605047/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"凉水坐锅，水开后蒸至15分钟，闷一、二分钟开盖取出。","img":"images/605047/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}